Package: create.project
Title: Create Reproducible Research Projects, R Packages and Papers
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Simon", "Labarthe", , "simon.labarthe@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Bootstraps a project in one call. 'research' projects get a
    numbered data pipeline with renv; 'package' projects get the standard R
    package layout. Both get git, a license, a README and a paper skeleton
    (LaTeX or Quarto) built on good practices.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/SimonLabarthe/create.project
Imports:
    fs,
    gert,
    renv,
    usethis,
    utils
Suggests:
    quarto,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    tinytex,
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
